OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation launched
OL,4,Aafter body found
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation is under way
OL,7,Fafter the body of a man was discovered
OL,8,Fin a property.
OL,10,FNorthamptonshire Police said it
OL,11,Fbelieved the man, in his 50s, died
OL,12,Fseveral days before his body was found.
OL,14,FOfficers went to the property on High
OL,15,FStreet in Burton Latimer on Wednesday
OL,16,Fafternoon after receiving a "concern
OL,17,Ffor welfare" call.
OL,19,FFollowing a forensic post-mortem
OL,20,Fexamination on Thursday at Leicester
OL,21,FRoyal Infirmary, detectives launched
OL,22,Fthe murder investigation.
